WEBVTT

equipment
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
You will need gauze, cotton wool, cardboard, pencil, cup, sticky paper and scissors.

cotton
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:30.000
For the eye pad, spread a cotton wool ball into an oval shape about 5 to 6 centimetres wide.

gauze
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Fold the gauze around the cotton wool.

pad-tape
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Tape at the open end.

trim
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Trim the edges of the gauze to the shape of the cotton wool.

finished-pad
00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.000
This is your eye pad.

cardboard
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:13.000
For the shield, find some clean cardboard. Reusing medical packaging works well.

draw
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Using a cup as a template, draw a circle with a diameter of about 8 centimetres.

cut
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Cut out the circle.

slit
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:47.000
Then make a cut from the edge to the centre.

cone
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Curve the card into a cone and secure with sticky tape.

finished-shield
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:08.000
This is your eye shield.
